            <profile id="360b-84bc-e664-9a20" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour, shield and warhorse. May upgrade to partial plate or full plate armour (+2 pts), lance (+4 pts), and cloth barding (+4 pts). Noble Commander: substituted for unit Leaders in units of Knights; roll a D6 for each before deployment on the Noble Commander Attributes chart (1 Young Hotspur: +1 Attack, Impetuous roll 1 or 2; 2 Venerable Leader: Ld 9; 3 Potential Usurper: Ld 7 for him and the unit, which cannot use the General's Ld; 4 Defiant/Reluctant Leader: unit subject to Allies &amp; Mercenaries rule; 5 Charismatic Leader: Knights may re-roll misses once; 6 Notable Reputation: +1 WS and fear). All units of Knights in the army must be led by a Noble Commander, who cannot lead any other type of unit (one Noble Commander per Knights unit is enforced as a ratio). (Armies of Chivalry p.44)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="eeed-626a-26a6-1b52" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">4+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
                <!-- armour-save -->
              <modifier type="set" field="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1" value="3+">
                <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="09be-11bc-e978-73c7" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="4fcf-088e-d0b1-9994" type="atLeast"/>
