              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, shield, and thrusting or throwing spear. May upgrade to light armour (+2 pts). May upgrade to heavy armour (+4 pts). Open Order, Feigned Flight. Lithuanians become Close Order if they upgrade to heavy armour. (Armies of Chivalry p.45)</characteristic>
